nf-core/dualrnaseq 1.0.0 — call bin/ scripts by name.

AWS Batch has no shared filesystem: `$workflow.projectDir/bin/x.sh` points at the Galaxy
container's path, absent on the Batch host ("replace_attribute_gff.sh: No such file or directory",
test profile 2026-11-06). Nextflow uploads bin/ with the run and puts it on each task's PATH, so
the scripts are called by name; `python|Rscript|bash <path>` becomes a direct call (every bin script
is executable with a shebang). Mechanical rule over main.nf — all three forms
($workflow.projectDir/bin/, ${…}/bin/, !{…}/bin/); applied by scripts/sync_to_dev.sh.

